WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.910
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright is not allowed

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:09.080
to go to fan conventions, let alone use them
as recruitment drives.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.750
Especially not at Furry Conventions!

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:16.150
We’re fully aware that, due to the dangerous
nature of the work, staff turnaround at the

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.160
SCP Foundation is much higher than your typical
non-profit organization.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:25.580
That does not, however, mean we need to stoop
to hiring random people at conventions to

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.390
work with us in order to make up the numbers
we lose.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:34.550
And Jack, we swear to the O5 Council, if you
convince one more group of furries to download

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:41.960
Mal.0 as some kind of dating service, we warn
you, the consequences will be severe.

